  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Relief shown pictorially.; Ships and a sea monster are in the ocean.; The scale cartouche includes fruit and a face, while the title caroutche includes two fish on the bottom, a woman on the left holding a snake, and an angel on the right holding a chalice and a cross.; Does not match any states in Van der Krogt due to the lack of text on the verso.; From the Jansson Appendix Atlas 1636-1680, title created to represent a unique collection within the Clark Library, University of Michigan.",
